# Frontend Environment Configuration

# OpenAI API Configuration
# Get your API key from: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
# WARNING: Never expose API keys in client-side code!
# Use Next.js API routes to proxy requests to OpenAI
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-proj-your-actual-openai-api-key-here

# API Configuration
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:3001

# Instructions:
# 1. Visit https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
# 2. Sign in to your OpenAI account
# 3. Create a new API key or copy an existing one
# 4. Replace the OPENAI_API_KEY placeholder above with your actual key
# 5. For production, use API routes to keep keys secure
# 6. Restart the Next.js dev server after updating this file
